Development builds retain the prepared world's settings; these are not package
publication builds. All parallel compilation uses the 16 logical CPUs. No
home-directory build/repository overrides, installation, publication, service
changes or reboot occurred. The host lacks /dev/dtrace. Live firing, overhead,
hardware devices, kernel runtime races and actual autofs/CUSE/9P services
remain unverified. Source census breadth is not proof every subsystem has
adequate probes; the explicit zero-evidence inventory is a follow-up map.
